{"id":"c7ee47bb037aa758","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-sigma-type-compat.md","title":"sigma-type — Compatibility alias","display":"sigma-type — Compatibility alias","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-sigma-type-compat","aliases":["16-df-sigma-type-compat","16-sigma-type"],"display":"sigma-type — Compatibility alias","depends_on":["[[16-df-sigma-type]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-sigma-type-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-sigma-type-compat</span><span>16-sigma-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"sigma-type — Compatibility alias"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"48233b115b99f8c2\" href=\"?note=48233b115b99f8c2\" title=\"16-df-sigma-type\">16-df-sigma-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\mathcal U,\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\Gamma,\\mathcal U,\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"48233b115b99f8c2\" href=\"?note=48233b115b99f8c2\" title=\"16-df-sigma-type\">16-df-sigma-type</a> 的小集合族条件，分别代入其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{x:\\sigma}\\tau\">\\(\\Sigma_{x:\\sigma}\\tau\\)</span> 是该页定义的族。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\)</span> 为本页引入的兼容记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_{x:\\sigma}\\tau\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{x:\\sigma}\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_{x:\\sigma}\\tau\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{x:\\sigma}\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>别名保持完整语境参数；纤维元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,y)\">\\((x,y)\\)</span>，总空间元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\gamma,(x,y))\">\\((\\gamma,(x,y))\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-sigma-type","status":"resolved","id":"48233b115b99f8c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-sigma-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-sigma-type","status":"resolved","id":"48233b115b99f8c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\mathcal U,\\sigma,\\tau$ 满足 [[16-df-sigma-type]] 的小集合族条件，分别代入其中 $A,B$；$\\Sigma_{x:\\sigma}\\tau$ 是该页定义的族。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\mathcal U,\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{x:\\sigma}\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_{x:\\sigma}\\tau\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{x:\\sigma}\\tau.","display":true},{"tex":"(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\gamma,(x,y))","display":false}],"bytes":781,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-329","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-sigma-type-compat|sigma-type — Compatibility alias]]"}],"outgoing":["48233b115b99f8c2"]}